DETAIL: Key (during)=(["2026-01-01 03:30:00","2026-01-01 04:30:00")) conflicts with existing key (during)=(["2026-01-01 03:00:00","2026-01-01 04:00:00")).
OBJECTS: schema=public table=a163_bk constraint=a163_bk_during_excl

> ROLLBACK
-- ROLLBACK

> BEGIN
-- BEGIN

